---
// Services.astro → APEX Signature Athletic Programs
---

<section class="section services" id="programas" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="services__header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">DISCIPLINAS DE AUTOR</span>
      <span class="volt-line"></span>
      <h2 class="display-heading services__heading" id="services-heading">
        Programas de <span class="highlight-volt">Alto Rendimiento</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="services__desc">
        Clases de intensidad graduada dirigidas por head coaches y atletas de nivel competitivo. Cupos limitados para garantizar supervisión técnica personalizada.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services__grid" role="list">

      <!-- Programa 1: Volt / Hyrox -->
      <div class="service-card service-card--volt reveal reveal-delay-1" role="listitem" tabindex="0">
        <div class="service-card__top">
          <span class="service-card__num">№ 01</span>
          <div class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card__badge-row">
          <span class="service-tag">⚡ ALTA INTENSIDAD</span>
          <span class="service-meta">60 MIN · 850 KCAL</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card__title">Hyrox Engine Lab</h3>
        <p class="service-card__desc">
          Entrenamiento metabólico de competición. Combinaciones de carrera sobre césped sintético, empuje de trineos Prowler, SkiErg, remos y burpees con estándares de carrera oficial.
        </p>
        <a href="#contacto" class="service-card__link">
          <span>Reservar Cupo</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Programa 2: Cyan / Weightlifting -->
      <div class="service-card service-card--cyan reveal reveal-delay-2" role="listitem" tabindex="0">
        <div class="service-card__top">
          <span class="service-card__num">№ 02</span>
          <div class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M6 5v14M18 5v14M2 12h20M6 9H3M6 15H3M18 9h3M18 15h3"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card__badge-row">
          <span class="service-tag">🏋️ FUERZA &amp; TÉCNICA</span>
          <span class="service-meta">75 MIN · IWF ELEIKO</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card__title">Olympic Weightlifting</h3>
        <p class="service-card__desc">
          Perfeccionamiento técnico en arrancada (Snatch) y dos tiempos (Clean &amp; Jerk). Análisis de trayectoria de barra por video y periodización de fuerza máxima absoluta.
        </p>
        <a href="#contacto" class="service-card__link">
          <span>Reservar Cupo</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Programa 3: Flame / Boxing -->
      <div class="service-card service-card--flame reveal reveal-delay-3" role="listitem" tabindex="0">
        <div class="service-card__top">
          <span class="service-card__num">№ 03</span>
          <div class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 8v8M8 12h8"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card__badge-row">
          <span class="service-tag">🥊 COMBATE &amp; AGILIDAD</span>
          <span class="service-meta">50 MIN · 700 KCAL</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card__title">Combat Boxing Club</h3>
        <p class="service-card__desc">
          Fundamentos de boxeo profesional en ring y bolsas de agua Aquabag. Trabajo de pies, reflejos, esquivas defensivas y rounds de alta demanda cardiovascular.
        </p>
        <a href="#contacto" class="service-card__link">
          <span>Reservar Cupo</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Programa 4: Titanium / Reformer -->
      <div class="service-card service-card--titanium reveal reveal-delay-4" role="listitem" tabindex="0">
        <div class="service-card__top">
          <span class="service-card__num">№ 04</span>
          <div class="service-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card__badge-row">
          <span class="service-tag">🧘 CONTROL &amp; CORE</span>
          <span class="service-meta">55 MIN · REFORMER PRO</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="service-card__title">Athletic Reformer</h3>
        <p class="service-card__desc">
          Pilates dinámico de alta resistencia sobre camas Allegro 2. Enfoque en alineación escapular, estabilizadores profundos de la columna y prevención biomecánica de lesiones.
        </p>
        <a href="#contacto" class="service-card__link">
          <span>Reservar Cupo</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.services {
  background: var(--color-bg);
  position: relative;
}

.services__header {
  margin-bottom: 4rem;
  max-width: 640px;
}

.services__heading {
  font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.highlight-volt {
  background: var(--grad-volt);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}

.services__desc {
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  font-size: var(--fs-md);
  line-height: var(--lh-loose);
  font-weight: 400;
}

/* Grid */
.services__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 1.5rem;
}

/* Card */
.service-card {
  background: var(--color-bg-card);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  padding: 2.25rem 1.75rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.service-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
}

.service-card--volt:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-volt);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.3);
}
.service-card--volt .service-card__num,
.service-card--volt .service-card__icon,
.service-card--volt .service-card__link { color: var(--color-volt); }

.service-card--cyan:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-cyan);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
}
.service-card--cyan .service-card__num,
.service-card--cyan .service-card__icon,
.service-card--cyan .service-card__link { color: var(--color-cyan); }

.service-card--flame:hover {
  border-color: var(--color-flame);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 85, 0, 0.3);
}
.service-card--flame .service-card__num,
.service-card--flame .service-card__icon,
.service-card--flame .service-card__link { color: var(--color-flame); }

.service-card--titanium:hover {
  border-color: #FFFFFF;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
}
.service-card--titanium .service-card__num,
.service-card--titanium .service-card__icon,
.service-card--titanium .service-card__link { color: #FFFFFF; }

.service-card__top {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.service-card__num {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
}

.service-card__icon {
  width: 44px;
  height: 44px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
}

.service-card__badge-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.service-tag {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--color-volt);
  background: rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.1);
  padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
}

.service-meta {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
}

.service-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 1.35rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: #FFFFFF;
  margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.2;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.service-card__desc {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: var(--color-cream-muted);
  line-height: 1.65;
  font-weight: 400;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  flex: 1;
}

.service-card__link {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: var(--ls-wide);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  transition: gap 0.3s ease;
  margin-top: auto;
}

.service-card:hover .service-card__link {
  gap: 0.85rem;
}

@media (max-width: 1100px) {
  .services__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .services__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
</style>

